sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant F as Funcionário
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AUTH as λ authenticate
    participant AZ as λ authorize
    participant DB as RDS (users, profiles)
    participant APP as App principal (EKS)

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over F,DB: A — Login (POST /auth/login, rota pública, sem authorizer)
    F->>GW: POST /auth/login { cpf, password }
    GW->>AUTH: invoke (rota pública)
    AUTH->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE document_number = $1
    DB-->>AUTH: linha do usuário (ou nenhuma)
    Note right of AUTH: bcrypt.compare(senha, hash)<br/>+ checa deleted_at
    AUTH-->>GW: 200 { accessToken, expiresIn }
    GW-->>F: 200 { accessToken, tokenType, expiresIn }
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 235)
    Note over F,APP: B — Acesso a rota protegida
    F->>GW: GET /service-orders (Authorization: Bearer <token>)
    GW->>AZ: invoke authorizer (cache miss)
    Note right of AZ: verify JWT: assinatura, exp, iss, aud<br/>+ role x rota (access-policy)
    AZ-->>GW: Allow + context { userId, role }
    GW->>APP: GET /service-orders + x-user-id, x-user-role
    APP-->>GW: 200
    GW-->>F: 200
    end

    Note over GW,AZ: Cache do authorizer: TTL 300s por token.<br/>Deny (nunca chega ao App): sem token/malformado → 401 · token inválido/expirado → 401 ·<br/>perfil não autorizado → 403 · rota desconhecida → 403 (default deny)
